able.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2106ba11326cfe10\" href=\"?note=2106ba11326cfe10\" title=\"58-df-indiscernible.md\">58-df-indiscernible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,M,L,\\varphi,\\bar p,s_0,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\">\\(A,M,L,\\varphi,\\bar p,s_0,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\)</span> (subset, structure, language, formula, parameters, assignment, and satisfaction data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9DefinableSubsetOverModelSelected}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9DefinableSubsetOverModelSelected}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9DefinableSubsetOverModel}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9DefinableSubsetOverModel}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (selected-data predicate and existential projection defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> (structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (structure-universe operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_L\\)</span> (free-variable operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s_0)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S\\)</span> are the assignment, set-function, and finite-update predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}definable\\text{-}subset\\text{-}over\\text{-}model\\text{-}selected} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9DefinableSubsetOverModelSelected}_S(A,M,L,\\varphi,\\bar p;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s_0)\\land\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar p,m,\\mathrm{Univ}(M))\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in m+1\\}\\land\nA\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\\exists\\bar a,t\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar a,m+1,\\mathrm{Univ}(M))\\land\\bar a(0)=x\\land\n\\forall i\\in m\\;(\\bar a(i+1)=\\bar p(i))\\land\n\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S(t,s_0,\\bar a,m+1,M)\\land\n(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,t))\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}definable\\text{-}subset\\text{-}over\\text{-}model\\text{-}selected} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9DefinableSubsetOverModelSelected}_S(A,M,L,\\varphi,\\bar p;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s_0)\\land\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar p,m,\\mathrm{Univ}(M))\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in m+1\\}\\land\nA\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\\exists\\bar a,t\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar a,m+1,\\mathrm{Univ}(M))\\land\\bar a(0)=x\\land\n\\forall i\\in m\\;(\\bar a(i+1)=\\bar p(i))\\land\n\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S(t,s_0,\\bar a,m+1,M)\\land\n(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,t))\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}definable\\text{-}subset\\text{-}over\\text{-}model\\text{-}unselected}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9DefinableSubsetOverModel}_S(A,M,L,\\varphi,\\bar p)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9DefinableSubsetOverModelSelected}_S(A,M,L,\\varphi,\\bar p;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}definable\\text{-}subset\\text{-}over\\text{-}model\\text{-}unselected}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9DefinableSubsetOverModel}_S(A,M,L,\\varphi,\\bar p)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9DefinableSubsetOverModelSelected}_S(A,M,L,\\varphi,\\bar p;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The selected eight-place predicate uses a registered finite update and an explicit parameter-sequence domain. The public five-place predicate has a distinct symbol and existentially binds the recursive satisfaction interpretation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-4"